# Prototype & design-system fidelity

**Visual source (subordinate to Cursor Rules / PRD):** [`docs/prototypes/{{MAIN_PROTOTYPE_HTML}}`](docs/prototypes/{{MAIN_PROTOTYPE_HTML}})  
**Optional landing HTML:** additional file in `docs/prototypes/` if product has a standalone marketing page (map in `prototype_route_mapping.md`)  
**Token canon:** [`docs/default_docs/{{INTERIM_DESIGN_SYSTEM_DOC}}`](docs/default_docs/{{INTERIM_DESIGN_SYSTEM_DOC}}) (until UX-03 `visual_identity_contract.md`)  
